    },
    {
      "description": "Replace an account's password (e.g. after its login failed, or with a new App Password):\nstored in the OS keyring only, then the login is tested; the result arrives in the\naccount's `status`. Not undoable (the old password is not kept). Only the user can do\nthis (GUI, TUI or CLI); agents (MCP) get `origin_not_allowed`.",
