        }
      },
      "required": [
        "cmd",
        "args"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "description": "Add an address the account sends from (an alias), or change the name or signature of one\n(the account's own address included). The signature is added to new drafts from that\naddress. Undoable. Only the user can do this (GUI, TUI or CLI); agents (MCP) get\n`origin_not_allowed`.",
